"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Masterwork Lightsaber"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you are armed with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," that you built, you gain a +2 morale bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to use the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," and ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]}," Talents.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Masterwork Lightsaber"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you build a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Construction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Construction","referenceId":"reference:4e15cf68aad68938"},"), you do so with such expertise that it makes the weapon even more refined and elegant. When you build a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", you can choose to add one extra ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Accessory or Modification"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Accessory_or_Modification"}," at the time of creation. And, when you hit a target with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," that you built, you can always choose to reroll one damage die from your damage roll, but you must accept the result of the reroll, even if it is worse.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition, you can mentor another character while they construct their own ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},". When you do so, you reduce the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check DC for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Construction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Construction","referenceId":"reference:4e15cf68aad68938"}," by -5.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Perfect Attunement"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Masterwork Lightsaber"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to add to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attack roll made with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," you built, you can add that same amount to the damage roll if the attack hits.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Quick Modification"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Masterwork Lightsaber"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend 1 minute modifying a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," you have built, removing one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Accessory or Modification"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Accessory_or_Modification"}," and putting a different one its place. Gamemasters may rule that some modifications cannot be added or removed in this way due to rarity of materials or the difficulty of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Modification"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Modification"}," (such as adding or removing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Electrum Detail"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Electrum_Detail","referenceId":"reference:c92a1b5d260e2008"},").\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
